  "original_script": "Stop watching boring AI videos. If you want to really learn AI, you should not just copy code or call APIs. You must understand how they work from the inside.\n\nThis channel will make AI concepts simple and visual. We are starting two tracks:\n\nFirst: Fundamental Maths for AI — where we will understand the basic math behind AI with simple animations.\n\nSecond: Generative AI & Agentic AI — where we will build smart AI agents that can think, plan, and work together.\"\n\nGreat question, Maya! We will not teach outdated theory. Instead, we will explore the latest research and understand the what, why, and how behind every concept. We will write code together, build real projects, test ideas, and learn by doing.\"\n \n\nWelcome to the channel. Please subscribe, and check the description for the link. Tell me, what AI topic do you want to learn first?\""
}